# Copy

- Do not invent product or marketing copy. Relocate or delete; the human writes replacement voice.
- No copy-pasteable bash or curl-pipe on the homepage. Setup commands belong in the README.
- Prefer short, specific UI strings. Do not generate “companion / seamless / one-time about 15–30 minutes” tone.
- Do not add “world-class / delightful / premium” language to docs or UI.
